{"id": "34558", "title": "爱一下，好不好？", "author": "岑扬", "category": "文学名著", "count": 42, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34558.htm", "intro": "领悟是件很可怕的事！他深深这么认为。它像是灵光一闪，但留下的不见得是好东西，否则——为什么一听见她生病请假就像老妈子杀到她家？为什么甘心被她亏，被她损，被她使唤？想他好歹是桃花朵朵开的警局名草，为什么会傻傻地选择一个不懂浪漫为何物，不擅表达情感，枪法比谈情说爱技巧更高明的女人？为什么这太多为什么却激荡出令人毛骨悚然的领悟！他在耍蠢吗？爱上一个对死去男友无法忘怀的女人，这么难爱的人——啧！他怎么跟已经持有冥府护照的男人抢女人！这难度实在太高了，他该如何打赢这场仗？而她到底能不能释放点爱情给他？一点点就好？", "base": "files/article/html/34/34558", "chapters": [{"title": "序言", "file": "2191519.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2191520.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2191521.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2191522.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2191523.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2191524.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2191525.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2191526.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2191527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2191528.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2191529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2191530.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2191531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2191532.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2191533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2191534.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2191535.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2191536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2191537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2191538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2191539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2191540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2191541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2191542.html", "available": false}, {"t